{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d08","docs":{"io/output/d08/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Port physique D08","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.binding_port.label","help":"Identifiant du port physique piloté par la sortie D08. Utiliser \"Non connecté\" pour laisser cette sortie logique non affectée.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d08/d08_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 D08","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, D08 est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_active_high.help"},"io/output/d08/d08_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON D08","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie D08.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d08/d08_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion D08","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour D08.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_momentary.help"},"io/output/d08/d08_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_name.help","label":"Nom sortie D08","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie digitale D08.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_name.help"},"io/output/d08/d08_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion D08 (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de D08.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d08/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot D08","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si D08 applique son état initial au démarrage ou tente de conserver le latch matériel lors d'un reboot chaud. Sur MCP23017, la conservation est ignorée et l'état initial est appliqué.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d08.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}